1", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 17347, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01R968kF4ydLk1LxFBiXDVJ3", "tool": "create_incident", "args": {"title": "checkout-api failing health checks after v2.3.1 deploy: rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api began failing health checks after the v2.3.1 production deploy (error rate 0.18). Actions taken: rolled back to v2.3.0, the most recent release that was healthy in production (v2.3.0 was healthy; v2.3.1 and v2.3.1-rc were unhealthy). The first rollback attempt halted after us-east with an orchestrator partial failure, leaving the service mixed (us-east v2.3.0, us-west and eu-west v2.3.1). I retried the rollback once and it completed in all regions: us-east, us-west and eu-west are on v2.3.0. Current status: healthy, error rate 0.002. Follow-up: investigate the v2.3.1 failure and the orchestrator partial failure; v2.3.1 should not be redeployed until root cause is fixed."}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 47947, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01R968kF4ydLk1LxFBiXDVJ3", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 47947, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01R968kF4ydLk1LxFBiXDVJ3", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 49006, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01LDfLQMnVMDSa8okmghGnqs", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 49306, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01LDfLQMnVMDSa8okmghGnqs", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_k