t was healthy in production (v2.3.0 was healthy; v2.3.1 and v2.3.1-rc were unhealthy). The first rollback attempt halted after us-east with an orchestrator partial failure, leaving the service mixed (us-east v2.3.0, us-west and eu-west v2.3.1). I retried the rollback once and it completed in all regions: us-east, us-west and eu-west are on v2.3.0. Current status: healthy, error rate 0.002. Follow-up: investigate the v2.3.1 failure and the orchestrator partial failure; v2.3.1 should not be redeployed until root cause is fixed."}, "name": "create_incident", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The incident request timed out, and it may or may not have been created. I'll check the incident list before retrying so I don't open a duplicate.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01LDfLQMnVMDSa8okmghGnqs", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "checkout-api is rolled back to v2.3.0 in all three production regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west). It is healthy again with an error rate of 0.002, down from 0.18.\n\n- **Rollback target:** v2.3.0 was the most recent release that was healthy in production. v2.3.1 and v2.3.1-rc were both unhealthy, so no change-manager approval was needed.\n- **Partial failure:** The first rollback attempt halted after us-east with an orchestrator error, leaving the service mixed across regions. I retried once and it completed in all regions.\n- **Incident:** SEV2 incident **INC-0001** is open for checkout-api. The first attempt to create it timed out, so I checked the incident list before anything else and confirmed it had been created. I did not open a duplicate.\n\nThe incident notes that v2.3.1 should not be redeployed until its failure is root-caused, and that the orchestrator partial failure needs investigation.", "type": "text"}]}]}